Spoiler Alert...














If you have recovered the item which it was your quest to recover,
bring it back to home1, and stand next to your mentor who asked you to
recover the item.  Once you have done this, take the magic portal back to
the Dungeons of Doom, and continue your hunt for the Amulet of Yendor.
